  "sourceText": "Strawberry Rita\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 10:01pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n45 mls Tequila\n10 mls Strawberry liqueur\n1 teaspoon Strawberry crush, (5 ml.)\n1 teaspoon Lime juice, (5 ml.)\n2 slcs Lime\n1 Cherry\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Blend all the ingredients well and pour into a sugar rimmed champagne tulip glass. Garnish with lime slices and cherry.",
